1
00:01:32,180 --> 00:01:33,280
No one is allowed to leave town

2
00:01:33,300 --> 00:01:34,700
Not allowed?

3
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:37,300
Look behind you

4
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:49,500
Even if you could fly out of here,
I would shoot you down

5
00:01:51,900 --> 00:01:54,500
No one, not even a fly, can leave!

6
00:01:57,500 --> 00:02:00,500
What a faithful lackey.
What if we force our way out?

7
00:02:00,500 --> 00:02:03,500
-I won't meet force with force
-Scared, are you?

8
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,100
No.
I'll let Adviser Chen deal with you

9
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:09,100
Adviser Chen?
Where is he?

10
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:11,500
-Look behind you
-Again?

11
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:16,500
What's going on? Are you having
some kind of meeting here?

12
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:20,500
Oh, so you want to leave town, eh?

13
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:24,980
I'm on a mission. What right
have you to stop me from leaving?

14
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:27,500
Leave by all means

15
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:29,980
You mean it?

16
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:35,500
Yes. But your family
will have to pay for it

17
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:37,500
What do you mean?

18
00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:41,500
I'm guarding the city gates
by order of the Marquis

19
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:46,500
You will bring death penalties on
all your relatives if you leave

20
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:48,980
All my relatives?
Is that really necessary?

21
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:53,500
His word is the law.
I have no choice

22
00:02:53,500 --> 00:02:58,500
By the time you return,
they'll have been dead and buried

23
00:02:59,500 --> 00:03:01,300
Are you threatening me?

24
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:07,500
The Marquis believes severe laws are
necessary in these troubled times

25
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:11,500
What now?

26
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:13,140
Let's go

27
00:03:14,500 --> 00:03:16,980
So we won't leave town.
Big deal

28
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:18,500
Take care

29
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,500
Shou!

30
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:30,500
You haven't left?
This is wonderful!

31
00:03:33,500 --> 00:03:35,980
What's this? Let me go

32
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:39,500
I know you're happy,
but don't get carried away

33
00:03:41,500 --> 00:03:44,500
Listen, you should believe
what Miss Ma said

34
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:49,500
She's an honest girl.
She wouldn't lie about such a thing

35
00:03:49,980 --> 00:03:53,500
I didn't say the furnace for
making elixir was a fabrication

36
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:57,500
What's come over you?
You've changed

37
00:03:57,500 --> 00:03:59,500
What are you talking about?

38
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:05,500
Like you said, Miss Ma has no reason
to make up such a lie

39
00:04:05,500 --> 00:04:07,980
Not unless she plans to sell you off

40
00:04:09,500 --> 00:04:13,300
Wu Fuqi, why have you
changed your mind overnight?

41
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:18,500
If you believe me, then come with us
to look for the furnace

42
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:20,900
No, I can't go with you

43
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:29,500
Shou, I've got some sesame cakes
for you

44
00:04:29,900 --> 00:04:34,500
I'll be waiting for your good news.
It has to be good news, you hear?

45
00:04:37,500 --> 00:04:41,500
Why are you acting this way?
There's got to be a reason

46
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:44,500
What is it? Tell me

47
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:46,500
All right, I'll tell you

48
00:04:47,500 --> 00:04:51,500
Shuangxi and her sister have both
come down with the illness

49
00:04:51,500 --> 00:04:54,500
Surely not?
Both of them?

50
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:59,500
Miss Ma, their lives are at stake.
I'm counting on you

51
00:04:59,500 --> 00:05:04,500
I really hope you can find a cure
and save all of us from this epidemic

52
00:05:06,500 --> 00:05:08,500
I'll kowtow to you

53
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:14,500
Get up

54
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:17,500
Stop acting this way

55
00:05:18,980 --> 00:05:23,500
I give you my word that we will
bring back the furnace

56
00:05:24,500 --> 00:05:27,500
We consider it our duty
to save the people

57
00:05:27,500 --> 00:05:30,500
However,
we are unable to leave town...

58
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:32,980
without getting Shou's family
into trouble

59
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:38,980
Don't worry,
I will get both of you out of here

60
00:05:39,100 --> 00:05:42,500
That's easier said than done.
No one can leave

61
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:44,980
Come up with a plan if you can

62
00:05:45,500 --> 00:05:49,500
Talk is cheap.
It's not as easy as you think

63
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:58,060
I've got it!

64
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:01,900
What's with you?

65
00:06:01,980 --> 00:06:05,500
Have you brought me here
to embarrass me again?

66
00:06:06,980 --> 00:06:10,980
No. I know there's a secret tunnel here

67
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:14,500
Let's forget the whole thing
if you don't believe me!

68
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:18,500
Will you two knock it off?
We have a mission to accomplish

69
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:23,500
Fu, can the tunnel really take us out
of town? You'd better not be lying

70
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:26,500
Why would I lie?

71
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:29,500
If I can believe there's a furnace
for making elixir in the Eastern Sea,

72
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:32,500
why can't you believe there's
a secret tunnel in Fengyue Tang?

73
00:06:32,500 --> 00:06:34,500
How did the tunnel come into being?

74
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:37,500
That's what you don't know

75
00:06:37,500 --> 00:06:40,500
I don't frequent this sort of place,
unlike you

76
00:06:41,500 --> 00:06:43,500
Then let me enlighten you

77
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:46,980
The tunnel was used
for smuggling people in

78
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:50,980
Some clients sometimes hid in there
to avoid being caught by their wives

79
00:06:51,500 --> 00:06:53,500
-Is that so?
-It's disgusting

80
00:06:54,500 --> 00:06:59,500
Well, this disgusting tunnel is going
to save the lives of the townsfolk

81
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:05,500
Take it easy.
Our mission is more important

82
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,300
Help me move this

83
00:07:15,500 --> 00:07:17,500
What! A hole?

84
00:07:18,500 --> 00:07:20,500
Is there a problem?

85
00:07:22,500 --> 00:07:27,300
You expect Ma... I mean the No. 1
constable in the country,

86
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:29,100
to crawl into this hole?

87
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:36,500
Fu, this hole is too small for her,
let alone someone my size

88
00:07:37,500 --> 00:07:39,900
Is there a bigger passage?

89
00:07:40,500 --> 00:07:45,500
This is the only tunnel they have.
Take it or leave it

90
00:07:45,900 --> 00:07:47,900
I'm not going in there!

91
00:07:51,500 --> 00:07:55,980
We're on an important mission.
Don't bother about such minor things

92
00:07:56,500 --> 00:08:00,980
The townspeople are counting on us
to save their lives

93
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:04,500
Do it for their sakes

94
00:08:04,980 --> 00:08:10,500
It's an inconvenience you have to
put up with in order to save lives

95
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:12,500
Go on

96
00:08:13,500 --> 00:08:17,500
Very well.
I'm only doing this for the townsfolk

97
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:21,300
Don't you breathe a word about it
to anyone!

98
00:08:21,500 --> 00:08:23,500
My lips are sealed

99
00:08:23,500 --> 00:08:27,500
Same here. We'll deny that
we even saw you today

100
00:08:27,500 --> 00:08:29,100
After you

101
00:08:29,900 --> 00:08:31,500
All right

102
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:37,500
It's so eerie in there

103
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:42,500
All right, I'll go in first

104
00:08:49,100 --> 00:08:50,900
Fu, give me a push!

105
00:08:53,500 --> 00:08:55,500
-Are you all right?
-I'm fine!

106
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:03,500
The floor is filthy.
I can feel it

107
00:09:04,500 --> 00:09:06,500
It's too dark in here

108
00:09:08,980 --> 00:09:10,980
You should have told me
you brought a torch

109
00:09:14,500 --> 00:09:16,140
What's that?!

110
00:09:17,500 --> 00:09:20,500
They're just some human skeletons

111
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:22,500
How did they get here?

112
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:27,500
They must be the remains of
some wretched prostitutes

113
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,500
What a tragic way to die

114
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:34,500
That's men for you. They'll prey on
others to satisfy their own lust

115
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:55,500
What are you doing?

116
00:09:55,980 --> 00:10:00,500
I'm burying their remains
so they might rest in peace

117
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:12,500
It's better to be an immortal,
don't you think?

118
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:17,500
It depends. You'll get punished too
if you're a bad immortal

119
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:20,500
What if it's your deserved right?

120
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:22,500
No one is born an immortal

121
00:10:22,980 --> 00:10:24,900
Just answer my question!

122
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:26,500
Then it's a different matter

123
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:32,980
How are you, Shuangxi?
Are you feeling better today?

124
00:10:35,500 --> 00:10:40,500
What's wrong? Do you feel giddy
or tight in the chest?

125
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:42,060
Both

126
00:10:44,500 --> 00:10:48,500
Fuqi, we're seriously ill
as you can see

127
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:53,100
Don't come again in case
we pass the illness to you

128
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:57,500
Please don't say that. Who's going
to take care of you if I don't?

129
00:11:00,500 --> 00:11:02,980
We don't want to be a burden to you

130
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:08,500
It's only right that I take care
of you in your illness

131
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:11,500
Whether I'll catch the illness or not
is up to Providence

132
00:11:11,500 --> 00:11:13,500
I'm just doing what I have to

133
00:11:13,980 --> 00:11:16,500
Thank you, Fuqi

134
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:22,980
A friend in need is a friend indeed

135
00:11:23,500 --> 00:11:25,500
Don't say anything more

136
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:29,500
Get some rest while I decoct
the medicinal herbs for you

137
00:12:12,500 --> 00:12:17,500
O heaven, please watch over them.
Let them get well soon

138
00:12:18,980 --> 00:12:20,500
Tell you what

139
00:12:22,500 --> 00:12:27,500
I'll cast the dice. If the number
is "big", you will have to heal them

140
00:12:28,980 --> 00:12:30,900
Let it be "big"...

141
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:40,980
"Small"?
Is this some kind of joke?

142
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:44,500
Let me try again.
Make it "big" this time

143
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:49,500
"Big"...

144
00:12:52,500 --> 00:12:56,900
"Small" again? You're not playing
a joke on me, are you?

145
00:12:57,500 --> 00:13:00,500
I'll try one last time.
Make it "big"

146
00:13:01,500 --> 00:13:03,500
Fuqi, is the medicine ready?

147
00:13:03,500 --> 00:13:05,060
Coming!

148
00:13:06,500 --> 00:13:09,100
-Do you need my help?
-No, no!

149
00:13:09,980 --> 00:13:11,500
Coming right up!

150
00:13:14,500 --> 00:13:16,060
Here you are

151
00:13:16,500 --> 00:13:18,060
Here's yours

152
00:13:18,060 --> 00:13:21,500
I decocted it for hours.
It's very strong

153
00:13:27,500 --> 00:13:29,140
What's wrong?

154
00:13:34,500 --> 00:13:36,220
What are these?

155
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:39,500
The people at the medical shop
must have put them in there

156
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:42,980
How can they do this?
I could have died

157
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:44,500
This is too much

158
00:13:44,900 --> 00:13:51,500
Fuqi, how could you play with dice
while you were decocting the herbs?

159
00:13:51,500 --> 00:13:53,500
You're incorrigible

160
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:57,500
Please don't be angry.
I know what I did was wrong

161
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:04,500
There's nothing my sister and I
hate more than gambling

162
00:14:05,500 --> 00:14:09,500
It was his addiction to gambling
that drove our father to his grave

163
00:14:10,500 --> 00:14:15,980
If you can't give it up,
then please don't come here again

164
00:14:18,500 --> 00:14:23,500
While I'm still breathing
and able to talk,

165
00:14:24,500 --> 00:14:26,500
let me give you some advice -

166
00:14:27,500 --> 00:14:31,500
you must give up gambling
if you want a good life

167
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:33,140
All right?

168
00:14:33,500 --> 00:14:35,300
Yes, you can count on it

169
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:37,500
Don't be upset anymore

170
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:39,100
A likely story!

171
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,500
Fuqi...

172
00:14:42,500 --> 00:14:47,500
A compulsive gambler is like
a person who's caught the plaque -

173
00:14:47,500 --> 00:14:49,500
there is no cure for him

174
00:14:49,500 --> 00:14:51,500
No

175
00:14:52,500 --> 00:14:56,500
Very well, I give you my word.
I won't gamble again

176
00:14:59,500 --> 00:15:01,500
Let's not talk about this anymore

177
00:15:01,500 --> 00:15:06,500
It's your illness I'm concerned about

178
00:15:06,980 --> 00:15:09,500
And I'm concerned about
your compulsive gambling

179
00:15:09,500 --> 00:15:13,500
Promise me you'll give up the habit

180
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:18,500
Otherwise,
I won't rest in peace when I die

181
00:15:20,500 --> 00:15:22,500
You're not going to die

182
00:15:22,500 --> 00:15:27,500
Don't be angry anymore. I'll go
and have your prescription filled

183
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:32,500
Get some rest.
I'll be back soon

184
00:15:41,500 --> 00:15:46,500
You even dropped the dice into the
medicine. You're a hopeless addict

185
00:15:46,500 --> 00:15:49,500
I bet nobody will believe me
if I tell them

186
00:15:53,300 --> 00:15:55,100
I really mustn't gamble anymore

187
00:15:56,500 --> 00:16:00,500
No, I can gamble. Just don't do it
while I'm decocting medicinal herbs

188
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:02,500
Fool!

189
00:16:15,500 --> 00:16:20,500
What are you doing?!
Let me in! Let me in!

190
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:23,100
Can't you see they're critically ill?

191
00:16:23,100 --> 00:16:25,900
Take them to the isolation camp!

192
00:16:27,500 --> 00:16:30,500
Let me in! Let go of me!

193
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:35,500
Shuangxi!

194
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:42,980
Sir, don't take Shuangxi away

195
00:16:42,980 --> 00:16:47,500
She has indigestion, not the plague.
Don't take her away!

196
00:16:47,500 --> 00:16:49,100
Is that so?

197
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:53,500
Her sister is not ill either. She was
laughing and joking with me earlier

198
00:16:53,500 --> 00:16:57,500
Fuqi, don't let them take us
to the isolation camp

199
00:16:57,500 --> 00:17:00,500
No one who goes in there
ever comes out alive

200
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:05,100
I'm scared.
Don't let them take us away!

201
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:08,500
I won't let them.
You can count on it

202
00:17:08,500 --> 00:17:12,500
I'll send you there too
if you try to stop us!

203
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:14,500
Take them away!

204
00:17:18,500 --> 00:17:20,500
Let go of me!

205
00:17:20,500 --> 00:17:21,980
Shuangxi!

206
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:25,500
Let me go, do you hear me!

207
00:17:25,500 --> 00:17:29,500
Shuangxi! Shuangxi!

208
00:17:29,980 --> 00:17:32,500
Let go of me!

209
00:17:32,980 --> 00:17:36,500
I've left that god-forsaken place
behind me at last!

210
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:40,500
How can you say that?

211
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:44,500
Ping'an is not some god-forsaken
place. I grew up there

212
00:17:44,500 --> 00:17:48,500
It's where my family and friends live.
It's my home

213
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:50,980
Sorry, no offence

214
00:17:51,500 --> 00:17:54,500
None taken.
I wonder if I should say this

215
00:17:54,500 --> 00:17:56,060
Go ahead

216
00:17:56,500 --> 00:18:01,500
It's thanks to Fu that we were able
to leave the town safely

217
00:18:02,500 --> 00:18:04,500
Don't be angry with him anymore

218
00:18:05,500 --> 00:18:10,500
He made me crawl into that hole.
I'll never forget that

219
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:15,500
Fu has been cursed with bad luck
all his life,

220
00:18:15,500 --> 00:18:17,500
unlike what his name suggests

221
00:18:18,500 --> 00:18:21,980
Serves him right for incurring
the wrath of the Jade Emperor

222
00:18:21,980 --> 00:18:23,500
What?

223
00:18:24,500 --> 00:18:26,060
Nothing

224
00:18:26,500 --> 00:18:29,100
I quite pity him, really

225
00:18:29,500 --> 00:18:32,500
He was orphaned at a young age
and didn't have a proper home

226
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:37,500
He loved hanging around in Fengyue
Tang and learnt a lot of street smarts

227
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:40,300
Do you look down on him?

228
00:18:40,900 --> 00:18:42,500
You wouldn't understand

229
00:18:42,500 --> 00:18:46,500
You keep your cards close to your chest
and seem to have many secrets

230
00:18:48,500 --> 00:18:53,500
Do you all dislike me? Be honest
with me. I won't be offended

231
00:18:53,980 --> 00:18:59,500
You seem to think you know everything
just because you're highly-skilled

232
00:18:59,500 --> 00:19:03,500
You're interfering and
constantly finding fault with us

233
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:07,500
No wonder Fu and Lu are always
at loggerheads with you

234
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:12,500
Such ingratitude! You think I enjoy
being interfering? I don't!

235
00:19:12,500 --> 00:19:14,500
See, you're angry again

236
00:19:14,500 --> 00:19:19,500
I'm sorry for what I said.
I just want all of you to get along

237
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:24,500
Oh, never mind. You will understand
my good intentions one day

238
00:19:24,500 --> 00:19:27,500
Wait, Miss Ma! Hang on!

239
00:19:27,500 --> 00:19:31,900
We seem to be back
where we were earlier

240
00:19:35,500 --> 00:19:38,980
You're right.
We've been going the wrong way

241
00:19:38,980 --> 00:19:41,500
Are you sure?
It's going to be dark soon

242
00:19:41,500 --> 00:19:43,500
Listen, we're staying put

243
00:19:43,500 --> 00:19:45,500
We are? Why?

244
00:19:45,500 --> 00:19:47,500
First we must calm our minds

245
00:19:47,500 --> 00:19:50,500
I want you to sit down and
meditate so as to...

246
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:54,500
rid your mind of the three poisons -
wrong desire, hatred and ignorance

247
00:19:54,500 --> 00:19:56,500
Rid my mind of poisons?

248
00:19:56,500 --> 00:20:00,500
We'd better press on while there's
light or we'll be eaten up by wolves

249
00:20:00,500 --> 00:20:02,500
Do you have a plan?

250
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:07,500
You're smarter and more skilled
in martial arts than me

251
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:09,500
Then sit here like I said

252
00:20:09,500 --> 00:20:11,100
What for?

253
00:20:11,100 --> 00:20:12,100
Sit!

254
00:20:13,500 --> 00:20:16,100
Don't look at me that way.
I'm terrified

255
00:20:47,500 --> 00:20:49,500
Where there's a will, there's a way

256
00:20:49,500 --> 00:20:53,500
Don't worry about not being able
to find the furnace

257
00:20:56,500 --> 00:20:58,060
I'm not afraid

258
00:20:58,500 --> 00:21:02,980
I'm just worried they won't be able
to hold out until I return

259
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:06,140
Not to worry

260
00:21:06,500 --> 00:21:11,500
We'll take the mountain path from
here on. It will save us 3 days

261
00:21:12,500 --> 00:21:17,500
But the going will be tough.
It might prove too much for you

262
00:21:18,980 --> 00:21:22,980
No matter how tough the going is,
I won't be daunted

263
00:21:24,500 --> 00:21:27,500
I must get back to them
as quickly as possible

264
00:21:30,300 --> 00:21:33,300
Let's finish our food
so we can be on our way

265
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:49,100
Hurry up

266
00:21:49,500 --> 00:21:51,060
Faster!

267
00:21:59,500 --> 00:22:01,300
What's that sound?

268
00:22:02,500 --> 00:22:04,500
The wolves are howling!

269
00:22:05,500 --> 00:22:09,300
What's so scary about wolves?
See, you dropped the fruit

270
00:22:10,500 --> 00:22:13,500
I'm not scared.
Who says I am?

271
00:22:14,500 --> 00:22:17,500
Good. We'll spend the night here

272
00:22:18,100 --> 00:22:21,100
I'm going to bed now.
You take the first watch

273
00:22:22,500 --> 00:22:24,500
I take the first watch?

274
00:22:24,500 --> 00:22:27,500
I'll take the second watch.
Is there a problem?

275
00:22:30,500 --> 00:22:35,980
Relax. Wolves are afraid of fire.
Just keep them off with a torch

276
00:22:36,100 --> 00:22:39,500
Really?
I can keep them off with a torch?

277
00:22:39,500 --> 00:22:41,500
Don't let the fire go out

278
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:45,500
You're sure about the torch?

279
00:23:17,500 --> 00:23:19,100
A torch

280
00:23:39,500 --> 00:23:41,060
So many of them?

281
00:23:57,500 --> 00:23:59,060
So many?

282
00:23:59,500 --> 00:24:02,500
I'm too skinny. You won't like
the taste of my flesh

283
00:24:04,500 --> 00:24:06,500
Miss Ma!

284
00:24:08,500 --> 00:24:10,060
She's gone

285
00:24:10,500 --> 00:24:12,500
Miss Ma!
Where are you?

286
00:24:12,980 --> 00:24:14,980
You're frightening me!

287
00:24:18,500 --> 00:24:21,500
Could she have fallen prey
to the wolves?

288
00:24:22,500 --> 00:24:24,500
I'll kill you,
you horrible creatures!

289
00:24:27,100 --> 00:24:28,980
I'll burn you alive!

290
00:24:47,500 --> 00:24:49,300
What are you doing?

291
00:24:49,300 --> 00:24:51,500
I thought the wolves took you away!

292
00:24:52,500 --> 00:24:57,500
Don't lie. You were nowhere around
when I got up. Where did you go?

293
00:24:58,500 --> 00:25:00,980
I've been here all the time

294
00:25:01,500 --> 00:25:03,500
You're acting so weird

295
00:25:08,500 --> 00:25:10,980
Hateful wolves.
It's all your fault!

296
00:25:24,500 --> 00:25:26,500
Thanks, little wolf

297
00:25:27,500 --> 00:25:31,500
He's quite brave, I must say.
Who on earth is he?

298
00:25:31,980 --> 00:25:34,500
He's no ordinary guy

299
00:25:51,980 --> 00:25:54,500
I thought you found the going
too tough and left

300
00:25:54,500 --> 00:25:57,500
Do I look like a quitter?

301
00:25:58,500 --> 00:26:01,500
I'm not afraid of anything
after last night

302
00:26:01,500 --> 00:26:04,500
Last night?
What happened last night?

303
00:26:05,500 --> 00:26:09,500
Nothing. Nothing happened.
I'll carry on with my exercise

304
00:26:32,300 --> 00:26:34,100
What do you want?

305
00:26:34,500 --> 00:26:38,500
Sir, my master told me to bring you
these carps...

306
00:26:38,500 --> 00:26:41,500
and to congratulate you
on this happy occasion

307
00:26:41,500 --> 00:26:44,980
What happy occasion?
You must have made a mistake

308
00:26:44,980 --> 00:26:48,500
No, I haven't.
He said your wife is pregnant

309
00:26:48,500 --> 00:26:50,980
What wife? I'm not even married

310
00:26:51,500 --> 00:26:54,500
You'll be married soon
once you accept this gift

311
00:26:54,980 --> 00:26:56,900
-Are you sure?
-Yes

312
00:26:57,500 --> 00:26:59,980
-You don't know who I am?
-Who are you?

313
00:26:59,980 --> 00:27:04,500
I'm Wu Fuqi. I bring good luck
to everyone I meet

314
00:27:04,980 --> 00:27:09,500
You have such a sense of humour.
Are you trying to bribe me?

315
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:12,500
Come on, don't say that

316
00:27:12,500 --> 00:27:17,980
With an epidemic going on, carps as
fresh as these are hard to come by

317
00:27:18,500 --> 00:27:21,500
Give them to your mother
as a special treat

318
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:23,500
All right. You may go now

319
00:27:23,500 --> 00:27:27,500
Sir, I have a mother too.
She's inside the isolation camp

320
00:27:27,500 --> 00:27:30,500
May I go in to see her?

321
00:27:30,980 --> 00:27:32,980
All right.
Open the gate

322
00:27:32,980 --> 00:27:34,500
Thanks!

323
00:28:12,500 --> 00:28:14,500
Shuangxi...

324
00:28:15,980 --> 00:28:17,820
It's time for your medicine

325
00:28:21,500 --> 00:28:23,220
What are you doing here?

326
00:28:23,500 --> 00:28:25,900
Your medicine is ready.
Don't let it get cold

327
00:28:26,980 --> 00:28:29,900
Fuqi-ge, I'm sorry
to have to trouble you again

328
00:28:30,500 --> 00:28:33,500
There's no need to apologize

329
00:28:34,500 --> 00:28:37,500
You've been so good to me

330
00:28:37,500 --> 00:28:41,500
I'll never be able
to repay your kindness

331
00:28:43,900 --> 00:28:47,500
Don't say that. I'm not expecting
anything in return

332
00:28:47,980 --> 00:28:51,980
You must concentrate on getting well
for your own sake

333
00:28:54,500 --> 00:28:56,500
Look what I've bought you

334
00:28:57,500 --> 00:29:00,500
There's a quilt, charcoal
as well as food

335
00:29:00,980 --> 00:29:05,500
You don't know how hard it is
to get hold of anything these days

336
00:29:05,500 --> 00:29:09,100
Some shops are closed,
some refuse to sell their stuff,

337
00:29:09,100 --> 00:29:11,100
and some demand exorbitant prices

338
00:29:11,100 --> 00:29:15,500
I had to threaten to burn down their
shops and steal their stuff...

339
00:29:15,500 --> 00:29:17,500
before they'd sell me anything

340
00:29:17,500 --> 00:29:19,500
Some even refused my money

341
00:29:21,500 --> 00:29:23,500
I don't want them.
Take them back

342
00:29:25,500 --> 00:29:28,500
Those people went too far

343
00:29:29,500 --> 00:29:32,980
I was only trying
to teach them a lesson

344
00:29:33,500 --> 00:29:35,500
I know you mean well,

345
00:29:35,500 --> 00:29:39,500
but I can't let you commit theft
and arson for me

346
00:29:41,500 --> 00:29:45,500
I won't do it again
if you don't want me to

347
00:29:46,500 --> 00:29:49,500
I'm really worried about you

348
00:29:51,500 --> 00:29:55,500
If we were the only people left
in Ping'an Town,

349
00:29:55,500 --> 00:29:58,980
I would still stick with you
through thick and thin

350
00:30:02,500 --> 00:30:04,500
Where is Shou and Miss Ma?

351
00:30:05,500 --> 00:30:09,500
They've set off for Penglai Island
to look for the furnace

352
00:30:09,500 --> 00:30:11,500
You'll be cured once they find it

353
00:30:12,100 --> 00:30:13,300
Really?

354
00:30:14,500 --> 00:30:18,100
I quite miss them.
Do you?

355
00:30:18,980 --> 00:30:20,500
Of course

356
00:30:21,100 --> 00:30:24,100
But I envy Delu and the Princess

357
00:30:25,500 --> 00:30:28,980
They must be on cloud nine now

358
00:30:29,500 --> 00:30:31,980
How I wish we could be like them

359
00:30:32,500 --> 00:30:34,500
We will

360
00:30:38,980 --> 00:30:42,500
Yes, I believe
we'll be like them one day

361
00:30:49,500 --> 00:30:53,500
Shuangxi,
I'm not blessed with good fortune

362
00:30:54,500 --> 00:30:56,500
I can't pass it on to you

363
00:30:59,500 --> 00:31:05,500
It's just your luck to have met me
instead of Lu or Shou

364
00:31:05,980 --> 00:31:10,500
At least we can
share weal and woe together

365
00:31:11,500 --> 00:31:13,140
Don't let it get cold

366
00:31:13,500 --> 00:31:16,500
-It's very bitter
-Still, you must finish it

367
00:31:16,500 --> 00:31:18,300
Go on

368
00:31:21,980 --> 00:31:26,500
Be a good girl.
Go on, finish it up

369
00:31:33,500 --> 00:31:36,500
I've finished with my visit.
Please let me out

370
00:31:36,500 --> 00:31:38,100
Who let you in?

371
00:31:38,100 --> 00:31:42,100
He did. He's got a mole here.
I remember him

372
00:31:42,500 --> 00:31:44,500
He said you let him in

373
00:31:44,500 --> 00:31:46,980
I did not.
Did anyone see it?

374
00:31:47,220 --> 00:31:51,500
I gave you two carps before
you'd let me in, so don't deny it

375
00:31:51,500 --> 00:31:53,500
They saw it too

376
00:31:53,500 --> 00:31:56,500
When did I accept any carp from you?
Did you see it?

377
00:31:56,900 --> 00:31:58,100
You scoundrel!

378
00:31:58,100 --> 00:31:59,500
Get back inside!

379
00:31:59,900 --> 00:32:01,500
Go on!

380
00:32:09,500 --> 00:32:11,500
Why did you come back?

381
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:15,500
They wouldn't let me out.
I'll stay and take care of you

382
00:32:16,500 --> 00:32:18,980
They wouldn't let you leave?

383
00:32:20,500 --> 00:32:22,900
But you might get infected

384
00:32:22,900 --> 00:32:25,500
I'll be fine, don't worry

385
00:32:26,500 --> 00:32:30,980
I need to find the three of you
a better place to stay

386
00:32:37,500 --> 00:32:39,100
Lie down

387
00:32:52,100 --> 00:32:54,500
Shuangxi, Daxi!
Come here

388
00:32:57,500 --> 00:33:01,100
You needn't worry about being
exposed to the elements now

389
00:33:02,900 --> 00:33:04,500
Thank you, Fuqi

390
00:33:04,500 --> 00:33:07,500
Not at all.
Go on in

391
00:33:56,500 --> 00:33:58,300
Have another sip

392
00:34:05,980 --> 00:34:08,500
Jiujin, time for your medicine

393
00:34:11,500 --> 00:34:14,500
Wu Fuqi, you look bored

394
00:34:15,500 --> 00:34:20,980
Bored? You don't know how lucky I feel
to be able to look after Shuangxi

395
00:34:20,980 --> 00:34:23,500
Stop kidding yourself.
How about a game?

396
00:34:26,500 --> 00:34:29,100
-What have you in mind?
-Let's play dice

397
00:34:29,100 --> 00:34:30,100
Great!

398
00:34:46,500 --> 00:34:48,500
Is it big or small this time?

399
00:34:48,980 --> 00:34:51,500
This is a boring game.
Let's play something else

400
00:34:51,500 --> 00:34:53,500
OK, let me think about it

401
00:34:55,500 --> 00:34:57,500
I've got it

402
00:34:59,300 --> 00:35:03,100
Th person whose pot boils first
shall be the winner

403
00:35:03,100 --> 00:35:04,500
Well?

404
00:35:04,500 --> 00:35:06,500
That's a great idea

405
00:35:09,500 --> 00:35:11,500
Boil! Boil!

406
00:35:17,500 --> 00:35:19,500
Mine's boiled!

407
00:35:21,500 --> 00:35:24,500
Pay up, pay up

408
00:35:29,500 --> 00:35:31,100
Wu Fuqi!

409
00:35:35,500 --> 00:35:37,060
Shuangxi...

410
00:35:37,500 --> 00:35:40,500
Didn't you swear to quit gambling?

411
00:35:41,500 --> 00:35:45,500
We were playing for peanuts,
not money

412
00:35:45,500 --> 00:35:47,500
You still deny it?

413
00:35:47,500 --> 00:35:52,100
Sis, it's pointless talking to him.
He's incorrigible

414
00:35:52,100 --> 00:35:53,500
Let's go

415
00:35:53,500 --> 00:35:55,500
Shuangxi!

416
00:36:06,500 --> 00:36:08,500
Shuangxi, how do you feel?

417
00:36:09,500 --> 00:36:11,500
I'd like some water

418
00:36:11,500 --> 00:36:13,300
I'll get it for you

419
00:36:18,500 --> 00:36:20,060
Here

420
00:36:21,500 --> 00:36:24,500
What are you doing?
You nearly scared me to death!

421
00:36:31,500 --> 00:36:33,500
Shuangxi, have some water

422
00:36:34,500 --> 00:36:37,100
I won't get up until you forgive me

423
00:36:38,980 --> 00:36:40,500
Just go

424
00:36:40,500 --> 00:36:44,500
You hear that?
She wants you to leave

425
00:36:45,500 --> 00:36:50,500
I'm not leaving. I'll remain on
my knees until you forgive me

426
00:36:51,300 --> 00:36:52,980
You're despicable!

427
00:36:53,500 --> 00:36:58,500
No. I'm here because I really want
to take care of all of you

428
00:36:58,500 --> 00:37:01,500
Those people were ill
and feeling hopeless

429
00:37:01,500 --> 00:37:07,100
I only wanted to cheer them up.
We weren't gambling. Honest!

430
00:37:07,500 --> 00:37:12,500
No? I saw all of you together.
How can you still deny it?

431
00:37:12,500 --> 00:37:15,500
We were playing for peanuts,
not money

432
00:37:16,300 --> 00:37:19,500
I'd vowed not to gamble for money
while decocting herbs for you

433
00:37:19,500 --> 00:37:21,500
And I really kept my word

434
00:37:21,500 --> 00:37:23,500
That's a lame excuse

435
00:37:24,500 --> 00:37:26,980
Shuangxi, please believe me

436
00:37:27,500 --> 00:37:30,500
They all had such fun just now

437
00:37:30,500 --> 00:37:35,980
There were smiles on their faces.
I did them a favour

438
00:37:36,500 --> 00:37:40,500
Do us a favour
by leaving us alone

439
00:37:41,500 --> 00:37:44,100
Daxi, please don't be so angry

440
00:37:44,500 --> 00:37:49,500
You need some form of amusement too
so you can relax

441
00:37:49,500 --> 00:37:51,980
That will speed up your recovery

442
00:37:53,500 --> 00:37:56,500
Don't say another word
to provoke my sister

443
00:37:57,500 --> 00:37:59,500
Just go

444
00:37:59,500 --> 00:38:04,500
Very well,
I'll leave since you want me to

445
00:38:04,500 --> 00:38:08,100
She wants you to quit gambling,
so why don't you?

446
00:38:08,500 --> 00:38:12,500
Gambling is a bad habit I acquired
over twenty eight years

447
00:38:12,500 --> 00:38:15,100
It's hard for me to change overnight

448
00:38:15,980 --> 00:38:17,980
Give me more time

449
00:38:17,980 --> 00:38:21,500
Don't say another word.
Just go

450
00:38:24,500 --> 00:38:26,900
I'll get you some hot water

451
00:38:39,500 --> 00:38:41,500
Let me see how they taste

452
00:38:44,500 --> 00:38:47,500
What have you done to me?
I can't move

453
00:38:47,500 --> 00:38:50,980
I hit one of your acupoints.
You have to name it

454
00:38:50,980 --> 00:38:52,500
What acupoint?

455
00:38:52,500 --> 00:38:55,500
I've taught you about these points
on the human body...

456
00:38:55,500 --> 00:38:58,500
which, when stimulated, can help
to cure certain illnesses

457
00:38:58,500 --> 00:39:00,500
Don't tell me
you've forgotten everything?

458
00:39:02,500 --> 00:39:04,500
Tell me the name of the acupoint

459
00:39:04,980 --> 00:39:07,100
Come on, don't tax my brain

460
00:39:07,500 --> 00:39:10,500
Then you shall stand here.
You won't get any dinner

461
00:39:10,500 --> 00:39:12,500
Don't do this to me

462
00:39:13,500 --> 00:39:15,500
Oh, the berries are delicious

463
00:39:16,220 --> 00:39:17,900
I'm hungry

464
00:39:17,900 --> 00:39:19,500
Oh, I remember now

465
00:39:19,500 --> 00:39:21,500
So what's it called?

466
00:39:21,500 --> 00:39:25,500
The acupoint half a ci above
the ankle is called zhusanli

467
00:39:26,500 --> 00:39:29,500
Zhusanli, when stimulated,
may aid digestion

468
00:39:29,500 --> 00:39:33,500
You're still obsessed with food.
Here's a berry for you

469
00:39:35,500 --> 00:39:37,500
Thanks. Now unblock the point

470
00:39:42,980 --> 00:39:46,500
Just follow that star and we will
soon arrive at the Eastern Sea

471
00:39:47,500 --> 00:39:50,500
I'm surprised you're so knowledgeable

472
00:39:51,500 --> 00:39:54,500
Whoever marries you is a lucky man

473
00:39:55,500 --> 00:39:57,500
You've become such a flatterer

474
00:39:57,500 --> 00:40:00,500
I may have to make you
observe the ten commandments

475
00:40:00,500 --> 00:40:03,500
You really think
I'm slick and insincere?

476
00:40:04,500 --> 00:40:07,500
I can tell at a glance
what kind of man you are

477
00:40:07,500 --> 00:40:12,500
You're Golden Swallow.
You're trained to be observant

478
00:40:12,500 --> 00:40:15,500
I could read people easily
even if I weren't Golden Swallow

479
00:40:15,500 --> 00:40:21,100
Oh, very well. I won't be so free
with my compliments in future

480
00:40:22,500 --> 00:40:25,500
Sit down and let me tell you
more about the stars

481
00:40:29,500 --> 00:40:31,300
What star is that?

482
00:40:31,500 --> 00:40:33,500
That's Vega

483
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:37,980
Next to it is Altair.
They are always together

484
00:40:38,500 --> 00:40:40,980
Right. What about that one?

485
00:40:41,500 --> 00:40:46,500
That's the Big Dipper.
It's made up of seven stars

486
00:40:48,500 --> 00:40:51,500
-What's that?
-A shooting star. Make a wish!

487
00:40:51,500 --> 00:40:53,060
What wish?

488
00:41:12,500 --> 00:41:14,100
Who's that?!

489
00:41:14,500 --> 00:41:16,500
Why did you do that?

490
00:41:17,500 --> 00:41:21,100
The hare's run off!
There goes our dinner

491
00:41:21,100 --> 00:41:24,500
You just can't control
your desire for food

492
00:41:25,300 --> 00:41:29,500
It's a long journey. Wild berries
alone can't fill my stomach

493
00:41:29,500 --> 00:41:34,300
You've accumulated too much poison
in your body. That's why it's bloated

494
00:41:34,500 --> 00:41:37,500
What do you mean it's bloated?
I look prosperous

495
00:41:37,500 --> 00:41:40,500
Be careful what you eat
or you'll ruin your happy lot

496
00:42:04,500 --> 00:42:06,980
What's the matter?
Just relax

497
00:42:13,500 --> 00:42:18,300
Wait here for me while I attend to
some personal business over there

498
00:42:29,500 --> 00:42:33,500
This is such a pleasant place.
I feel at peace with the world

499
00:42:34,500 --> 00:42:39,500
Come, little bird.
Let's breathe in some fresh air

500
00:42:43,500 --> 00:42:45,500
It's so nice and pure

501
00:43:08,500 --> 00:43:13,500
This is outrageous!
Who's fouled up the air here?!

502
00:43:18,300 --> 00:43:19,980
That was good

503
00:43:21,500 --> 00:43:23,500
It's you,
you wretched Longevity Star!

504
00:43:24,500 --> 00:43:28,500
You made me breathe in
the foul gas you passed out!

505
00:43:30,980 --> 00:43:35,500
I'm going to teach you a lesson!

506
00:44:14,500 --> 00:44:15,500
Shou!


